(27, '2025-05-04', 'Seminar on Sustainable Maritime Future Under Leadership of Capt. Md Nasir Uddin', 'CUB\'s Shipping Dept. hosted a seminar on maritime sustainability, led by Capt. Nasir Uddin, with global experts on autonomy, green fuels & ship recycling.', 'https://cub.edu.bd/news_post.php?title=Seminar-on-Sustainable-Maritime-Future-Under-Leadership-of-Capt-Md-Nasir-Uddin', 'news\\2025-05-04_Seminar_on_Sustainable_Maritime_Future_Under_Leade.jpg'),
