(29, '2025-04-16', 'CUBLMC Successfully Hosts Research Workshop on Mooting with Guest Speaker Tahseen Lubaba', 'CUBLMC organized a successful Research Workshop on Mooting, featuring Ms. Tahseen Lubaba, BCL (Oxford), as the esteemed guest speaker.', 'https://cub.edu.bd/news_post.php?title=CUBLMC-Successfully-Hosts-Research-Workshop-on-Mooting-with-Guest-Speaker-Tahseen-Lubaba', 'news\\2025-04-16_CUBLMC_Successfully_Hosts_Research_Workshop_on_Moo.jpg'),
