(100, '2024-03-24', 'SUMMER ADMISSION is going on at Canadian University of Bangladesh', 'Summer 2024 session admission has been started at Canadian University of Bangladesh (CUB). Up to 100% scholarship opportunities are available for aspirant students.', 'https://cub.edu.bd/news_post.php?title=SUMMER-ADMISSION-is-going-on-at-Canadian-University-of-Bangladesh', 'news\\2024-03-24_SUMMER_ADMISSION_is_going_on_at_Canadian_Universit.jpg'),
